sections.text:
Violation of any provision of this Ordinance shall be punished as follows:

a. First Offense: Fine of Five Thousand Pesos (₱5,000.00) and imprisonment of not less than one (1) month but not more than three (3) months;

b. Second Offense: Fine of Five Thousand Pesos (₱5,000.00) and imprisonment of not less than three (3) months but not more than six (6) months, and suspension of City-issued permits and licenses for one (1) year;

c. Third Offense: Fine of Five Thousand Pesos (₱5,000.00) and imprisonment of not less than six (6) months but not more than one (1) year, and perpetual cancellation of City-issued permits and licenses;

Provided, that in case the violation has been committed by a juridical person, the person in charge of the management thereof shall be held liable.
